# WCS Axon Aggregates

Axon aggregates are command-side consistency boundaries using `@Aggregate`, `@AggregateIdentifier`, `@CommandHandler`, and event application methods.

Representative families:

- Execution: `WorkAggregate`, `ResourceWorkAggregate`, `ActivityWorkAggregate`, `TaskRequestAggregate`, `TaskGroupAggregate`, `ActivityTaskAggregate`, `ResourceTaskAggregate`, `ApmRunAggregate`.
- Configuration: `WorkflowAggregate`, `ApplicationAggregate`, `ApplicationSessionAggregate`, `AgentAggregate`, `EquipmentAggregate`, `LocationAggregate`, `WorkerAggregate`, `ZoneAggregate`, `SiteAggregate`.
- Inventory: `ContainerAggregate`, `PositionContentAggregate`, `AbstractAssetAggregate`, `EquipmentAssetAggregate`, `StorageAssetAggregate`.
- Integration: importer order/job/work aggregates and broker message services.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as REST/importer/agent
  participant G as Command gateway
  participant A as Aggregate
  participant E as Axon event store
  participant P as Projector
  C->>G: command
  G->>A: route by aggregate id
  A-->>E: persist domain event
  E-->>P: event processor delivery
  P->>P: update read model
```

Notable implementation details: work/container/equipment caches; `@AggregateMember` nested members in work-order/location aggregates; snapshot trigger configuration in inventory aggregates.

Related: [[WCS Commands Events Handlers]], [[TES PostgreSQL Persistence]].

Source: `tes-engine/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/engine/`, `tes-config/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/config/`, `tes-inventory/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/inventory/`, `tes-host-importer/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/host/importer/`.
